questions.prompt:
Complete the matrix. In each row, the right cell keeps only the symbols appearing in both left groups.
Row 1: {○, □, △} and {□, △, +} | {□, △}
Row 2: {★, +, ×} and {+, ×, ◇} | ?

Complete the matrix. In each row, the third cell contains all symbols from the first cell except those also in the second.
Row 1: {○, □, △} | {□} | {○, △}
Row 2: {+, ×, ★} | {×} | ?
